flowchart TD
  A[HR sets up Positions,<br/>Languages and Jobs] --> B[HR adds Candidate<br/>with a job or position<br/>Stage: Applied]
  B --> G[HR uploads CV<br/>and certificates]
  G --> H[HR assigns<br/>interviewers]
  H --> C[HR schedules interview<br/>Stage: Interview]
  C --> D[Interviewer scores<br/>10 criteria, 1 to 10]
  H --> D
  D --> E[HR reviews averages<br/>on Candidate Status]
  E --> F[Selected / Rejected / On hold<br/>with a reason]
  F -->|Selected| O[Stage: Offer]
  O --> J[HR moves to Hired]
  F -->|Rejected| R[Pipeline closed<br/>Rejected at the stage reached]
